<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The 33 "GOD" figures (Bon Iver / Eric Timothy Carlson + Aaron Anderson's video): her body
     face-down with legs splayed to the ring, his legs straight down past it — together tracing
     the peace-sign strokes inside the green circle. Hand-traced vector, personal dogfood build
     only — swap before any public release. -->
